1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,432
Di ujung jalan desa

2
00:00:02,613 --> 00:00:06,747
sosok terbungkus kain putih melompat sekali

3
00:00:06,996 --> 00:00:08,076
lalu diam

4
00:00:09,537 --> 00:00:12,165
Seorang peronda berhenti melangkah

5
00:00:12,532 --> 00:00:14,344
Senternya bergetar

6
00:00:14,828 --> 00:00:18,243
sebab ia tahu cerita tentang sosok itu

7
00:00:18,936 --> 00:00:19,674
pocong

8
00:00:20,706 --> 00:00:24,532
Pocong berarti terbungkus, dalam bahasa Jawa

9
00:00:25,206 --> 00:00:27,574
Maksudnya jenazah berkafan

10
00:00:27,594 --> 00:00:30,493
diikat di kepala, leher, dan kaki

11
00:00:30,513 --> 00:00:31,344
Konon

12
00:00:32,085 --> 00:00:36,065
jika ikatan kafan tidak dilepas saat dikubur

13
00:00:36,085 --> 00:00:39,884
arwahnya dipercaya terjebak dan tak tenang

14
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,522
Dalam sebagian cerita

15
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:44,812
empat puluh hari kemudian ia

16
00:00:44,832 --> 00:00:46,645
konon keluar dari kubur

17
00:00:46,665 --> 00:00:48,935
meminta ikatannya dilepas

18
00:00:48,955 --> 00:00:49,713
Konon

19
00:00:50,281 --> 00:00:53,655
ia melompat karena kakinya terikat

20
00:00:54,056 --> 00:00:56,768
Wajahnya dalam cerita pucat

21
00:00:56,788 --> 00:00:59,547
atau gosong bermata merah

22
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,090
Sumpah pocong, tradisi bersumpah berkafan

23
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:05,975
