24
00:01:06,581 --> 00:01:09,770
Seorang peneliti menilainya tak berdasar syariat

25
00:01:10,385 --> 00:01:12,581
Peneliti Frolova membaca pocong

26
00:01:12,601 --> 00:01:15,118
